{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"Y\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y每屏都有明确的高亮主线，能连续读出人物的心理变化；X在S03、S04、S08—S10、S12—S13缺少大字话线，单看大字会出现理解断档。small、core：Y的小字能补足高亮词之间的因果和关系，整条故事始终围绕亲密带来的幸福、对失去的担忧及接受不确定性展开；X的感受意象较多，有些屏幕甚至完全由感受撑起，容易让核心被淹没。concise：X略好，Y在S04、S05、S10等处有话与感受重复表达的情况，X的多种听法虽然数量多，但不少确实提供了不同的体验角度；human：Y略好，X的「晃得一下失重」「气息与体感荡开」「私语像放大成天地共振」等搭配或语序比较生硬，Y虽然也有「下方的脚步」「不安还没回答」等不够自然的表达，整体日常语言感更好。fine：X胜在身体感受具体、辨识度高，例如手不自觉收紧、夜里独处时泛酸、被心底翻涌的热度推着走；Y有些感受偏向音乐描写或概括性表达。load：Y的高亮词组短，意群边界清楚，扫读负担较小；X的大字经常是一整段较长的话，尤其S11、S14，多块累积后不容易快速扫完。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "53d9ea49-3e0f-4981-9c40-bb44542d9e7d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T185754404352Z", "elapsed_seconds": 280.672, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T19:02:35.090569+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ebe3bbae58be5bcbe20a86440ed6d5b6b3d55078d46f6e01b85427b853622f45", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0,